    "title": "22 arrested, 133 citations issued in Uptown and South End police operation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Connor Lomis ,\n8 hours ago CHARLOTTE, N.C. (WBTV) - A multi-agency police operation in Uptown and South End on Friday led to 22 arrests and more than 130 citations. The eighth “Queen City Safe” operation, which aimed to reduce violent crime while improving overall safety and quality-of-life concerns across the city, took place on Friday, Aug. 21. Read full article\n4",
